Package: xnglobord
Version: VERSION_PLACEHOLDER
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, xdotool, libfontconfig1
Maintainer: xNglobord project <noreply@example.invalid>
Description: Floating on-screen xi38 keyboard (Ubuntu port of xNglobord)
 A floating, always-on-top GTK keyboard for typing the xi38 script,
 ported from the xNglobord Android IME. Pick a target window and click
 (or long-press) keys to type into it via xdotool. Includes the pooled
 xi38 dictionary, candidates strip, and 11-font local font picker.
